Describe the current state of an element:

```tsx
// Checked state
<div
  role="checkbox"
  aria-checked={isChecked}
  tabIndex={0}
>
  Accept terms
</div>

// Expanded state
<button
  aria-expanded={isOpen}
  aria-controls="panel-1"
>
  Toggle Panel
</button>
<div id="panel-1" hidden={!isOpen}>
  Panel content
</div>

// Selected state
<li
  role="option"
  aria-selected={isSelected}
>
  Option 1
</li>
```

